			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20015033">
			</marker>
			<v n="33">
				The fear 
				<crossref let="n" cid="c20015033.65">
				</crossref>
				of the, 
				<crossref let="o" cid="c20015033.66">
				</crossref>
				LORD is instruction in wisdom, and humility comes before honor. Footnotes (1) 15:4 Or *healing* (2) 15:7 Or *the hearts of fools are not steadfast* (3) 15:30 Hebrew *makes fat* (ESV)
				<note nid="n20015033.33">
				</note>
			</v>
